&HEAD CHID='rt_blob2d_32_np4', TITLE='Role 3 e2e: 32x32 fine twin, 4 meshes' /
This is a driver test input of the Role 3 end-to-end tests (tests/run_e2e_driver.sh): doubly periodic unit square, two species of equal molecular weight (the second one is a passive
tracer; the tracer blobs and the constant velocity are set by the test mode, not by this input), uniform temperature.

&MESH IJK=16,1,16, XB=0.0,0.5,-0.05,0.05,0.0,0.5, MPI_PROCESS=0 /
&MESH IJK=16,1,16, XB=0.5,1.0,-0.05,0.05,0.0,0.5, MPI_PROCESS=1 /
&MESH IJK=16,1,16, XB=0.0,0.5,-0.05,0.05,0.5,1.0, MPI_PROCESS=2 /
&MESH IJK=16,1,16, XB=0.5,1.0,-0.05,0.05,0.5,1.0, MPI_PROCESS=3 /

&TIME T_END=1.0 /

&MISC SIMULATION_MODE='DNS', STRATIFICATION=.FALSE., NOISE=.FALSE., CFL_MAX=0.25 /

&RADI RADIATION=.FALSE./

&SPEC ID='BACKGROUND',BACKGROUND=.TRUE.,MW=28.0,VISCOSITY=0.002,SPECIFIC_HEAT=1.0 /
&SPEC ID='TRACER',MW=28.0,VISCOSITY=0.002,SPECIFIC_HEAT=1.0 /

&VENT PBX=0, SURF_ID='PERIODIC' /
&VENT PBX=1, SURF_ID='PERIODIC' /
&VENT PBZ=0, SURF_ID='PERIODIC' /
&VENT PBZ=1, SURF_ID='PERIODIC' /

&TAIL /
